{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Unemployed</i>, you are a down-on-luck wanderer from a distant future where jobs are extinct. With no income and looming debts, you venture to a desolate junk-planet teeming with discarded tech, rusted bots, and hidden dangers. Explore derelict landscapes, salvage materials, craft upgrades, and fight off rogue machines to earn credits and survive the harsh conditions. Every piece of scrap counts as you inch closer to your goal: paying rent and reclaiming some dignity in a world that forgot you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076660?t=1759973151","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076660?t=1759973151","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076660/ff73320a731280ba4a6a99b62bee3f9973c6cee6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759973151","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076660/ff73320a731280ba4a6a99b62bee3f9973c6cee6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759973151","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Unemployed</i>, you are a down-on-luck wanderer from a distant future where jobs are extinct. With no income and looming debts, you venture to a desolate junk-planet teeming with discarded tech, rusted bots, and hidden dangers. Explore derelict landscapes, salvage materials, craft upgrades, and fight off rogue machines to earn credits and survive the harsh conditions. Every piece of scrap counts as you inch closer to your goal: paying rent and reclaiming some dignity in a world that forgot you.</p>","developers":[" WelesGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076660/280d7a0404b8eaade5e28b5380ef3